 "snippet": "    // L7 — THE MOAT. One gate, plugged. Crossing on foot costs everything.\n    make(\n      7,\n      [\n        king(5, 8), pawn(4, 7), knight(7, 6), queen(2, 3), bishop(6, 4),\n      ],\n      {\n        ...FLEE,\n        moveLimit: 11,\n        hazards: [X(1, 5), X(2, 5), X(3, 5), X(5, 5), X(6, 5), X(7, 5), X(8, 5), X(4, 4), X(4, 6), X(4, 8), X(7, 8), X(6, 6), X(7, 7), X(3, 7)],\n        kingPen: ['e7', 'f7', 'e8', 'f8'],\n      },\n    ),"
